node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
*.log

# Internal working material: outdated release notes, acceptance/verification
# reports, evidence, audits and development guides live in /docs/internal and
# are never published. Public guidance lives in the READMEs and in the reviewed
# documents under /docs — the documentation index, the guide, the reference and
# developer pages, and the built-in Teams and Team Skills references — which are
# exceptions below and ship with the package. Everything else under /docs is
# internal.
/docs/internal/
/docs/**/*.md
/docs/**/*.html
# ...except the reviewed public documents, which do ship.
!/docs/guide/
!/docs/guide/*.md
!/docs/reference/
!/docs/reference/*.md
!/docs/developer/
!/docs/developer/*.md
!/docs/index.md
!/docs/index.zh.md
!/docs/builtin-teams.md
!/docs/builtin-teams.zh.md
!/docs/builtin-team-skills.md
!/docs/builtin-team-skills.zh.md
/CHANGELOG.md
/contrib/awesome-dsh-plugin/PR.md

# Tool artifacts: never published.
.brooks-lint-history.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
output/
